    "description": "<p>This Charm takes the form of a soulsteel-capped piston mechanism housed within one of the Alchemical's arms. Upon striking a foe in close combat, the piston fires at the moment of impact, empowering the blow with explosive pneumatic force. Successes on the supplemented attack roll are counted twice for the purpose of determining raw damage, or three times if the Alchemical is attacking unarmed.</p><p>Submodules: Optimized Demolition Vibration (Essence 3, 2xp): This submodule allows the Charm to supplement any attack made with a brawling aid weapon.</p>",
